# No co-authorship

Never add `Co-authored-by`, `Co-Authored-By`, or any similar trailer to git commits, pull requests, or commit message bodies.

Commit messages must name only the human author already configured in git. Do not attribute work to Cursor, Claude, Composer, or any other model or tool in trailers or footers.
